    "summary": "Follow-up randomized-block measurements confirm simd_reduction at 1M/8M (-33.5%/-41.9% C), read_read_offset at 128K/1M (-14.7%/-18.3%), producer_consumer_split at 1M (-26.2%), and scalar-fusion harm at 128K (+15.6%). Canonical producer_consumer remains neutral at 128K/1M, consistent with InvalidDependencies and no kernel fusion.",
